OL,3,GNEWSARape investigation at recreation
OL,4,Aground
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a rape have set up
OL,7,Fa cordon at a recreation ground.
OL,9,FThames Valley Police said a woman, aged
OL,10,Fin her 20s, reported being attacked
OL,11,Fnear the junction of Horspath Road and
OL,12,FRupert Road in Oxford on Sunday at
OL,13,Fabout 22:00 GMT.
OL,15,FThe force said the victim was being
OL,16,Fsupported by specially trained officers
OL,17,Fand neighbourhood officers remained in
OL,18,Fthe area to provide reassurance to the
OL,19,Flocal community.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
